{"sessions": "1", "seconds": 300.0, "legs": {"call06_agent": {"name": "call06_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_u9kjnlerq28h9l4y", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.22, "commit_t": 6.6, "transcript": "您好，Zentra 客服中心，很高兴为您服务，请问有什么可以帮您？", "latency_ms": 313.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.36, "commit_t": 11.9, "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "latency_ms": 233.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 16.44, "commit_t": 21.7, "transcript": "为了保障您的账户安全，需要核实一下您的身份，请问您的姓氏是？", "latency_ms": 302.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 38.16, "commit_t": 40.0, "transcript": "好的，不着急。", "latency_ms": 211.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 40.14, "commit_t": 46.6, "transcript": "如果升级以后还是不行，您把手机型号告诉我，我帮您核对是否支持。", "latency_ms": 315.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 52.76, "commit_t": 59.0, "transcript": "太好了，激活以后实体卡会自动停用，请您确认手机信号是不是正常。", "latency_ms": 290.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 66.34, "commit_t": 73.3, "transcript": "这个型号是支持的，我先帮您把二维码重新发送到您的邮箱，您可以直接在手机上打开。", "latency_ms": 322.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 74.32, "commit_t": 75.7, "transcript": "收到。", "latency_ms": 179.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 79.82, "commit_t": 84.3, "transcript": "在 App 的 Easy A 网页的按钮点击生成。", "latency_ms": 265.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 84.34, "commit_t": 86.9, "transcript": "二维码有效期是半小时。", "latency_ms": 173.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 86.94, "commit_t": 89.3, "transcript": "国旗需要重新生成。", "latency_ms": 154.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 95.74, "commit_t": 103.1, "transcript": "请您检查一下手机系统是不是最新版本，有的机型需要先做一次 OTA 升级才能识别。", "latency_ms": 346.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 109.28, "commit_t": 116.1, "transcript": "您需要准备身份证，并保证手机连着 WiFi，因为开通过程中会下载一个二维码配置。", "latency_ms": 326.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 121.8, "commit_t": 127.5, "transcript": "可以的，您可以在 App 里选择号码转 eSIM，不需要去营业厅。", "latency_ms": 306.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 128.42, "commit_t": 129.3, "transcript": "好的。", "latency_ms": 169.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 129.48, "commit_t": 132.0, "transcript": "我这边需要查询一下系统。", "latency_ms": 213.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 132.22, "commit_t": 135.6, "transcript": "大约需要一分钟，请您在线等待。", "latency_ms": 230.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 177.3, "commit_t": 180.6, "transcript": "谢谢您的耐心等待，我这边查到结果了。", "latency_ms": 250.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 192.36, "commit_t": 193.6, "transcript": "好的。", "latency_ms": 162.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 193.72, "commit_t": 196.0, "transcript": "还有什么需要帮助的吗？", "latency_ms": 212.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 202.32, "commit_t": 209.8, "transcript": "好的，请稍等，我帮您查询一下。我看到包裹昨天到达了您所在城市的分拨中心。", "latency_ms": 347.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 214.62, "commit_t": 216.8, "transcript": "最近快递量比较大。", "latency_ms": 170.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 216.8, "commit_t": 219.2, "transcript": "可能会延迟一天。", "latency_ms": 173.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 219.76, "commit_t": 222.4, "transcript": "预计明天下午会安排派送。", "latency_ms": 207.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 228.4, "commit_t": 234.3, "transcript": "同城修改地址一般不会影响时效，改好以后我会给您发一条确认短信。", "latency_ms": 309.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 240.72, "commit_t": 246.8, "transcript": "可以的，包裹还没有派送，我可以帮您修改，请您告诉我新的详细地址。", "latency_ms": 310.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 247.42, "commit_t": 249.2, "transcript": "", "latency_ms": 40.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 255.04, "commit_t": 260.5, "transcript": "好的，您可以直接回复订单短信，我这边收到以后会立刻处理。", "latency_ms": 281.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 29, "speech_t": 269.94, "commit_t": 272.8, "transcript": "今天的问题是否已经为您解决了？", "latency_ms": 219.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 30, "speech_t": 276.46, "commit_t": 279.7, "transcript": "感谢您的来电，祝您生活愉快，再见。", "latency_ms": 247.3, "failed": null}]}, "call14_agent": {"name": "call14_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_l8yfgh402pjhz5je", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.22, "commit_t": 6.5, "transcript": "您好，Veltra，我是客服专员，请问您需要办理什么业务？", "latency_ms": 291.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.88, "commit_t": 12.4, "transcript": "请问您的手机号码是多少？", "latency_ms": 217.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 21.76, "commit_t": 27.1, "transcript": "为了保障您的账户安全，需要核实一下您的身份。请问您的姓氏是？", "latency_ms": 294.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 42.36, "commit_t": 45.9, "transcript": "这种情况可能是设备本身的故障。", "latency_ms": 218.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 45.98, "commit_t": 50.0, "transcript": "您还在七天无理由退换的时间内，可以选择换货。", "latency_ms": 271.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 57.26, "commit_t": 62.1, "transcript": "最快明天下午，快递员会提前一个小时给您打电话。", "latency_ms": 267.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 67.48, "commit_t": 71.3, "transcript": "质量问题造成的换货，运费全部由我们承担。", "latency_ms": 244.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 71.3, "commit_t": 73.4, "transcript": "您不需要支付任何费用。", "latency_ms": 185.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 78.88, "commit_t": 80.0, "transcript": "不需要。", "latency_ms": 187.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 80.0, "commit_t": 87.3, "transcript": "我们会安排快递员上门取件，同时寄出新的设备，您只需要在家等待就可以。", "latency_ms": 301.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 88.64, "commit_t": 90.4, "transcript": "", "latency_ms": 43.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 94.64, "commit_t": 101.7, "transcript": "好的，换货单已经生成，您会收到一条短信，里面有取件的详细信息。", "latency_ms": 334.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 109.34, "commit_t": 117.8, "transcript": "好的，我帮您创建换货单，单号是 SO 一五三五六零，请您保留好原来的包装。", "latency_ms": 368.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 121.88, "commit_t": 126.8, "transcript": "新设备会在取件以后的第二天发出，预计三天内送到。", "latency_ms": 281.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 130.92, "commit_t": 136.8, "transcript": "为了核对您的信息，请您用手机键盘输入八位服务码。", "latency_ms": 281.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 136.94, "commit_t": 139.6, "transcript": "完成后，按井号键。", "latency_ms": 209.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 155.7, "commit_t": 156.8, "transcript": "需要的。", "latency_ms": 198.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 157.04, "commit_t": 162.3, "transcript": "账号是您的宽带账号，密码在您开通的时候收到的短信里面。", "latency_ms": 275.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 167.32, "commit_t": 172.3, "transcript": "在直播的时候，按遥控器的左键就可以回看过去七天的节目。", "latency_ms": 307.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 179.56, "commit_t": 187.0, "transcript": "好的，那请您长按遥控器的设置键五秒，选择恢复出厂设置，看看能不能重新加载。", "latency_ms": 350.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 190.74, "commit_t": 191.7, "transcript": "好的。", "latency_ms": 180.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 191.8, "commit_t": 194.3, "transcript": "我这边需要查询一下系统。", "latency_ms": 218.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 194.54, "commit_t": 197.9, "transcript": "大约需要一分钟，请您在线等待。", "latency_ms": 217.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 267.82, "commit_t": 271.1, "transcript": "谢谢您的耐心等待，我这边查到结果了。", "latency_ms": 251.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 275.6, "commit_t": 280.8, "transcript": "没关系，我可以帮您重置密码，新密码会发到您的手机上。", "latency_ms": 302.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 286.98, "commit_t": 294.8, "transcript": "这种情况多半是网络连接异常，请您检查盒子的网线或者 WiFi 是否连接正常。", "latency_ms": 318.4, "failed": null}]}}, "bot_rows": null}